<title>MOROCCO: Morocco paid $118/T C&amp;F for 46,000 T corn - trader.</title>
<headline>Morocco paid $118/T C&amp;F for 46,000 T corn - trader.</headline>
<dateline>TANGIER, Morocco 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco bought 46,000 tonnes of corn at $118 per tonne C &amp; F for delivery in two lots in August and September, a Moroccan trader said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The trader said the private AFAC feedstuffs group had purchased 20,500 tonnes for delivery August 10 to 20 and 25,500 tonnes for September 10 to 20 arrival.</p>
<p>U.S. trade sources said earlier the corn had been bought on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
